				TownNPCMood: {
					// Content: BAGU IS MY NAME.
					// NoHome: WHERE IS MY TEMPLE.
					// FarFromHome: I MUST RETURN TO MY TEMPLE.
					// LoveSpace: NO INTRUDERS DETECTED.
					// DislikeCrowded: DESTROY ALL INTRUDERS.
					// HateCrowded: DESTROY ALL INTRUDERS SLOWLY AND PAINFULLY WITH ENERGY SLASHES AND O.O.R.B.-SHAPED EXPLOSIVES.
					// LoveBiome: THIS IS MY TEMPLE.
					// LikeBiome: I MUST RETURN TO MY TEMPLE.
					// DislikeBiome: I MUST RETURN TO MY TEMPLE.
					// HateBiome: I MUST RETURN TO MY TEMPLE.
					// LoveNPC: THIS DIALOGUE DOES NOT EXIST.
					// LikeNPC: YOU SHOULD NOT BE SEEING THIS DIALOGUE.
					// DislikeNPC: SHOW MY NOTE TO RIVER MAN.
					// HateNPC: ERR 403.
					// LikeNPC_Princess: WHY IS THERE A CHILD HERE.
